        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.6.1+LEV.6.2+LEV.6.3+LEV.6.4+LEV.6.5+LEV.6.6+LEV.6.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 6.1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neitoki Olaitoriani ajoki Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tiaki iltung'ana le Israel Te neas olee aashu enkitok pooki engoki ake ninye naas iltung'ana aagil enkirukoto to Laitoriani, neaku ilo tung'ani olarruoni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nelimu ninye aibalunye ina ngoki nataasa, neitobir ninye elaata nalulung'a te ina kitarruoroto enye, aponaa erubata e imiet te ina, neisho ilo laa ninye einyala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake te nemeeta oltung'ani iltung'ana lenye ooidimi aatalaaki teina kitarruoroto, ore ina laakinoto neaku eno Laitoriani te nkaraki olapolosani neponikini ilo ker lo lningo lo sotua laa ninye eitobirakinyeki ninye olning'o lo sotua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nkishorot pooki, o ntokitin pooki naasinya oo ltung'ana le Israel, nena naayaki ninche ilo apolosani neaku inenyena; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o ntokitin naasinya e pooki tung'ani ake ninye neaku inolapolosani; ore pooki toki naba anaa enaisho oltung'ani olapolosani neaku eneye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nkituaak naamononisho ilmoruak lenye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Olaitoriani ajoki Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tiaki iltung'ana le Israel te nelo nepong'ori enkitok e likae moruo ake ninye, neas emarmalisho ti alo ninye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "te nelo neboitare olee ninye, neisudori ina bae too nkonyek o lmoruo lenye, neaku mejurrunoyu hoo neinosie kewan olduruk, nemeetae olchakeni oishakenoki ninye, amu eitu eibung'akini ina bae; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naa te nelotu oltau lo lom shumata ninye, netum olom ti alo ina kitok enye natipika kewan olduruk; aashu te nelotu oltau lo lom shumata ninye, netum ninye olom ti alo ina kitok enye hoo neitu ninye enosie kewan olduruk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchoo naa eriku ilo lee ina kitok enye enetii olapolosani, neyau enkishoroto naipirta ina kitok, erubata e tomon e efa e ntapa napuyiapui; nemebukoki ninye eilata shumata ina tapa nemepik enkorropil, amu olasar le ntapa lo lom ilo. Olasar le ntapa le ndamunoto, odamunyeki entorroni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Neyau olapolosani ina kitok aitinyiku, nepik ninye dukuya Olaitoriani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neitoki olapolosani ayau enkare nasinya te moti oo nkulupuok, neya enkiti terit to ltiren le ina aji e Nkai nepik atua ina are. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepik ilo apolosani ina kitok dukuya Olaitoriani, nelak ilpapit le ndukuya enye, nepik nkaik enyena ina tapa o lasar le ndamunoto, aa ninye o lasar le ntapa lo lom. Ore te nkaina enye neibung olapolosani ina are e nduaran naa ninye nayau oldeket. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neinosie taa olapolosani ina kitok olmumai, ejo, ‘Te nemeetae olee litaboitare, naa te neitu iyie imbelekenya aibelekenyakino olduruk, eton itii abori enkitoria o lmoruo lino, talakunoyu iyie tena are nadua nayau oldeket. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ti nitapong'ori iyie hoo nitii abori enkitoria o lmoruo lino, naa ti ninosie kewan olduruk neaku kitaboitare likae lee leme olmoruo lino,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(nchoo naa olapolosani einosie ina kitok olmumai lo ldeket, nejoki ina kitok), ‘Kintaa iyie o Laitoriani oldeket o lmumai ti atua iltung'ana linono, ti nikincho Olaitoriani meibibiari enkupes ino neiteijia osesen lino; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "metaa ore ena are nayau enduaran, nchoo elo atua enkoshoke ino, neiteijia osesen lino neibibiaa enkupes ino.’ Nejo ina kitok, ‘Esai, Esai.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Neitoki olapolosani aiger kulo deketa ti atua embuku, nejut ninche te ina are e nduaran, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neitook ninye ina kitok ina are e nduaran nayau oldeket ore ina are nayau oldeket nelo atua ninye nepik ninye emion kitok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki olapolosani aya ilo asar le ntapa otii enkaina e ina kitok, neyuk ilo asar le ntapa te dukuya Olaitoriani neitoki ayau enchumata o lperere lo lasar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki olapolosani aya emborei e nkaina e ilo asar le ntapa anaa erubata enye nadamuni, nepej ninye te nchumata o lperere lo lasar; ore te siadi neitoki aitook ina kitok enkare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee eidip aitooko ina kitok enkare, te nelo ninye neaku einosie kewan olduruk neas emarmalisho ti alo olmoruo lenye, ore ina are nayau oldeket nejing atua ninye nepik emion kitok, nejeyu osesen lenye neibibiari enkupes enye, neaku ina kitok oldeket ti atua iltung'ana lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake te neitu einosie ina kitok kewan olduruk metaa meeta ninye entioto, nelakunoyu ninye naa keiu nkera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
